stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Review : submit
  Review --> Draft : changes requested
  Review --> Approved : approve
  Review --> Rejected : reject
  state check <<choice>>
  Approved --> check
  check --> Published : auto
  check --> Scheduled : later
  Scheduled --> Published : time reached
  note right of Review
    reviewers are assigned round-robin
  end note
  state Published {
    direction TB
    Live --> Archived : expire
    Archived --> Live : restore
  }
  Rejected --> [*]
  Published --> [*]
  note left of Scheduled : waits for cron
